  "notes": [
    "Rish RM1300 / RM2300 (the EM13XX / EM23XX energy meters).",
    "Measured values are float32 input registers (FC04), most significant byte first, two registers per value, at the addresses of Table 1 (30001 = address 0). At most 20 parameters per request.",
    "The manufacturer's document covers the EM 2340, 1320, 1330 and 1340; this map assumes the RM1300 / RM2300 names share that table. Which parameters are valid depends on the wiring system (3P4W, 3P3W, 1P2W). Parameters beyond the first 51 (energy overflow counts and others) are not in this map.",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
